        "uri": "https://github.com/traefik/traefik/blob/v3.0.0/docs/content/migration/v2-to-v3.md",
        "locator": "L223-L263 (Migration Guide: From v2 to v3 › Static configuration › ConsulCatalog provider › namespace)",
        "excerpt": "#### namespace\n\nThe ConsulCatalog provider `namespace` option was deprecated in v2 and is now removed in v3.\nIt is now unsupported and would prevent Traefik to start.\n\n??? example \"An example usage of v2 ConsulCatalog `namespace` option\"\n\n    ```yaml tab=\"File (YAML)\"\n    consulCatalog:\n      namespace: foobar\n    ```\n\n    ```toml tab=\"File (TOML)\"\n    [consulCatalog]\n        namespace=foobar\n    ```\n\n    ```bash tab=\"CLI\"\n    --consulCatalog.namespace=foobar\n    ```\n\n##### Remediation\n\nIn v3, the `namespaces` option should be used instead of the `namespace` option.\n\n??? example \"An example us…",
